        "languages": [],
        "biography": "",
        "appearance": "",
        "notes": "<h5>Tactics</h5><p>A <strong>con artist</strong> is excellent in social situations, using their Inscrutable Expression feature to control conversations. Their Underhanded Sales ability works well to weaken their foes, whether in social situations or combat. In a fight, a con artist relies on deception to aid themselves and their allies, using Mislead to hinder their opponents and Create Distraction to get their allies to safety. With their Knife, a con artist can Disengage and flee if things start to look deadly.</p>",
        "role": "rival"
    },
